      <li>Construction</li>
      <li>Electronics</li>
    </prerequisites>
    <color>RGBA(0.412, 0.412, 0.412, 1.000)</color>
    <thoughtIcons>
      <li>UI/Buttons/UsePlanetDayNightSystem</li>
      <li>Things/Mote/Disoriented</li>
    </thoughtIcons>
    <assignmentTips>Covers most advanced buildings with few mechanical components, or workstations. Used with mechanics as a precursor to Engineering. Most industrial and basic spacer constructions should use this. Preindustrial backstories will almost never include this.</assignmentTips>
  </LifeLessons.ProficiencyDef>
